{"id":804383,"title":"02｜​什么是AI Agent？","content":"AI的发展经历了工具阶段、聊天机器人阶段、人机协同阶段，最终进入智能体（Agent）阶段。工具阶段以Photoshop为例，尽管操作熟练但效率低；聊天机器人如ChatGPT能生成大量内容，但无法实际完成任务；人机协同阶段，如GitHub Copilot和Office Copilot，辅助人类完成部分工作，但仍需人工监督与调整；智能体阶段则实现了自动化执行具体任务。智能体通过感知系统获取信息，利用大模型作为“大脑”处理数据，并通过API接口或硬件执行任务。例如，一个指令要求智能体判断天气并提供雨伞，它会查询天气预报并使用机械臂递送雨伞。整个过程模仿了人类的工作原理，从感知到决策再到行动。智能体的出现标志着从手动操作向自然语言驱动的转变，提高了工作效率和自动化水平。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":395202,"user_name":"若水清菡","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1099296,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"175C014E3B985D","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/c6/20/124ae6d4.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1729728386,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100801301,"comment_content":"老师可以分享一下ppt吗？","like_count":4},{"had_liked":false,"id":397906,"user_name":"Andy","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1119133,"ip_address":"黑龙江","ucode":"4BCA899B8E4E85","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/13/9d/0ff43179.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739881664,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100801301,"comment_content":"老师你的Copilot这个发音和网上不太一样。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":395852,"user_name":"小风","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1180256,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"A5D04FF18880C0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/02/60/8b9572ac.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1732258600,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100801301,"comment_content":"那行动里面的API是需要逐个开发的吗","like_count":0}]}